    "answer": {
      "short": "31 different sums.",
      "worked": "Each of the five notes can be included or excluded. Subtract the selection containing no notes.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=2^5-1\\\\N&=31\\end{align*}$$\n\nEach denomination exceeds the sum of all smaller denominations, so different selections give different sums. There are 31 different sums.",
